function displayTime(v){const s=String(v);let d;if(/^\d+(\.\d+)?$/.test(s)){const n=Number(s);d=new Date(n>1e11?n:n*1000)}else d=new Date(s.includes('T')?s:s.replace(' ','T')+(s.length>10?'+08:00':'T00:00:00+08:00'));return isNaN(d)?s:d.toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',hour12:false})}
views.records=async m=>{const r=await api('/api/messages?'+new URLSearchParams({contact,keyword,offset}));if(!m.isConnected)return;m.innerHTML=heading('聊天记录','消息与媒体记录一起浏览。JSON / CSV / HTML 单文件回导上限 150 MB；整库迁移使用完整备份。',`<div class="row"><select id="exportFormat" style="width:90px"><option value="json">JSON</option><option value="html">HTML</option><option value="csv">CSV</option></select>${button('导出会话','export')}</div>`)+`<div id="exportOutput" class="notice" role="status" ${results.exportOutput?'':'hidden'}>${esc(results.exportOutput||'')}</div><div id="exportOutputDownload">${downloadLink('exportOutput')}</div><div class="row section"><input id="recordSearch" class="grow" value="${esc(keyword)}" placeholder="搜索消息或发送者"><button class="button" data-action="search">搜索</button><button class="button" data-action="all">全部会话</button></div><div class="card split"><div class="contact-list">${state.contacts.map(c=>`<button class="contact-button ${c.contact===contact?'active':''}" data-contact="${esc(c.contact)}"><span class="avatar">${esc(c.contact[0])}</span><div><div class="contact-name">${esc(c.contact)}</div><div class="contact-meta">${fmt(c.total)} 条消息</div></div></button>`).join('')||empty('还没有记录')}</div><div class="conversation"><div class="conversation-head"><b>${esc(contact||'全部会话')}</b><span class="tag">${fmt(r.total)} 条匹配</span></div><div class="conversation-body" id="conversationBody">${r.rows.length?[...r.rows].reverse().map(row=>{const own=row.role==='self';const body=row.kind===1?row.content:`[${({3:'图片',34:'语音',43:'视频',47:'表情',49:'分享/文件',10000:'系统消息'})[row.kind]||'非文本消息'}]\n${row.content}`;return `<div class="bubble-row ${own?'own':''}"><span class="avatar">${esc((row.sender||'?')[0])}</span><div class="message-group"><div class="bubble-meta">${esc(row.sender)} · ${esc(displayTime(row.ts))}${!contact?' · '+esc(row.contact):''}</div><div class="bubble">${row.kind===1?esc(body):`<div class="message-type">${esc(body.split('\n')[0])}</div>${row.assets?.length?assetLinks(row.assets):'<div class="muted">尚未匹配媒体原文件</div>'}<details class="message-details"><summary>查看原始消息内容</summary><div>${esc(row.content)}</div></details>`}</div></div></div>`}).join(''):empty('没有匹配消息','试试其他会话或关键词')}</div><div class="conversation-foot"><button class="button small" data-action="newer" ${offset===0?'disabled':''}>较新消息</button><span>第${Math.floor(offset/100)+1}页 · 每页100条</span><button class="button small" data-action="older" ${offset+100>=r.total?'disabled':''}>较早消息</button></div></div></div>`;bind({search:()=>{keyword=$('#recordSearch').value;offset=0;return render('records')},all:()=>{keyword=$('#recordSearch').value;contact='';offset=0;return render('records')},newer:()=>{offset=Math.max(0,offset-100);return render('records')},older:()=>{offset+=100;return render('records')},export:()=>job('/api/export',{contact,format:$('#exportFormat').value},'exportOutput')});$('#recordSearch').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')$('[data-action="search"]').click()};$$('[data-contact]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{keyword=$('#recordSearch').value;contact=b.dataset.contact;offset=0;return render('records')});$('#conversationBody').scrollTop=$('#conversationBody').scrollHeight;bindAssets(r.rows.flatMap(row=>row.assets||[]));};
const assetUrl=f=>'/api/asset/'+encodeURIComponent(String(f.id));
function showAsset(f){const url=assetUrl(f),mime=f.mime||'',image=mime.startsWith('image/')&&mime!=='image/svg+xml';let body=image?`<img class="wide-image" alt="${esc(f.name)}" src="${esc(url)}">`:mime.startsWith('video/')?`<video class="wide-image" controls preload="metadata" src="${esc(url)}"></video>`:mime.startsWith('audio/')?`<audio controls preload="metadata" src="${esc(url)}"></audio>`:empty('此格式暂不支持浏览器预览');modal(f.name,body+`<div class="notice">无法预览时，原文件可能加密或编码不被支持。<a href="${esc(url)}" download>下载原文件</a></div>`)}
